From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bindings: include cstdint for std::uint8_t

Do not rely on standard library headers indirectly declaring fixed-width
integer types. GCC 13 no longer exposes std::uint8_t through the existing
include set.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
---
--- a/src/bindings/cpp/include/key.hpp
+++ b/src/bindings/cpp/include/key.hpp
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #define ELEKTRA_KEY_HPP
 
 #include <cstdarg>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <cstring>
 #include <functional>
 #include <locale>
